## Patch 3 — `src/index.css`

I don't have the current contents of `src/index.css`, so I cannot safely anchor a SEARCH block inside it. Append the following section at the end of the file. It deliberately avoids any global `button { transform/transition }` rule (which would collide with framer-motion) and only adds a token layer, a reduced-motion safety net, and an opt-in utility for non-CVA buttons.

```
### FILE: src/index.css (append at end)
/* ============================================================
   Luxury 3D Button System — global support layer
   Component styling lives in components/ui/button.jsx (CVA).
   These rules are additive only and must not introduce a
   blanket `button { transform }` rule (conflicts with framer-motion).
   ============================================================ */
@layer components {
  :root {
    /* Reusable luxury depth tokens (available for bespoke buttons). */
    --btn-bevel-strong: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16);
    --btn-bevel-soft: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    --btn-contact-shadow: 0 2px 4px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.50),
      0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.40);
    --btn-contact-shadow-hover: 0 6px 12px -2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55),
      0 3px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.40);
    --btn-pressed-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45),
      inset 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.30);
    --btn-focus-ring: #00e096;
  }

  /* Opt-in utility for buttons NOT rendered through the CVA component. */
  .btn-lux-surface {
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.10);
    box-shadow: var(--btn-contact-shadow), var(--btn-bevel-strong);
    transform: translateZ(0);
    transition: transform 150ms ease-out, box-shadow 150ms ease-out;
  }
  .btn-lux-surface:hover {
    transform: translateY(-1px);
    box-shadow: var(--btn-contact-shadow-hover), var(--btn-bevel-strong);
  }
  .btn-lux-surface:active {
    transform: translateY(1px);
    box-shadow: var(--btn-pressed-shadow);
  }
  .btn-lux-surface:disabled {
    opacity: 0.4;
    box-shadow: none;
    transform: none;
  }
}

/* Global reduced-motion safety net: strip elevation motion for any
   element wearing the luxury surface, regardless of source. */
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  .btn-lux-surface,
  .btn-lux-surface:hover,
  .btn-lux-surface:active {
    transition: none;
    transform: none;
  }
}
```

