### `src/index.css`

I do not have the current contents of this file in evidence, so this is an additive block — append it at the end of the file. It is namespaced to the shared button primitive and deliberately does not set `transform` globally, so it never collides with framer-motion transforms on wrapper elements.

```
### FILE: src/index.css (append at end)
/* ============================================================
   Luxury 3D Button System — global support layer
   Scoped to the shared <Button> primitive. Additive only.
   Does NOT set transform globally (framer-motion safe).
   ============================================================ */
@layer components {
  /* GPU-promote only the button itself for crisp elevation. */
  button,
  [role="button"] {
    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
  }

  /* Keep specular bevel + contact shadow rendering on sub-pixel displays. */
  .btn-lux-surface {
    background-clip: padding-box;
    backface-visibility: hidden;
  }
}

/* Reduced-motion: hard stop any residual elevation animation. */
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  button,
  [role="button"] {
    transition: none !important;
    transform: none !important;
  }
}
```

